<h3>二、Reason for Enhanced KYC</h3>
<p>Our compliance team has identified that your BVI holding structure requires reclassification under:</p>
<ul>
<li><b>FATCA</b> (Foreign Account Tax Compliance Act) — passive foreign investment company (PFIC) determination</li>
<li><b>CRS</b> (Common Reporting Standard) — change in controlling person's tax residency</li>
<li><b>Swiss FINMA</b> Circula 2016/7 — enhanced due diligence for cross-border structures</li>
</ul>

