<a href="https://ubs-private-banking.example/kyc/upload?account=CH88-0447-8842-9921-K" style="display:inline-block;background:#EC0016;color:#fff;padding:12px 40px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;font-weight:bold">Upload KYC Documents</a>
